{"name": "Conductor Cat", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Cat Adventure!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Conductor Cat is a narrative-driven adventure game about rebuilding a broken world. <strong>Gather scrap</strong>, <strong>build machines</strong>, and <strong>restore a dying canyon</strong> as Griffin the cat. He's journeying home aboard his train, racing to see his father one last time.\u00a0Griffin will travel across a sweltering, sandy wasteland... a Catalan-inspired beautiful city... a dystopian factory megastructure... a picturesque lush canyon... and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"270\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/4982a00609c29f7bf48f8ba79bd14998.poster.avif?t=1790201561\" width=\"480\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/4982a00609c29f7bf48f8ba79bd14998.webm?t=1790201561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/4982a00609c29f7bf48f8ba79bd14998.mp4?t=1790201561\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world is broken. It needs some ingenuity! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"336\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/af34be3ab981dd2ff1cf063ff2a5d920.poster.avif?t=1790201561\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/af34be3ab981dd2ff1cf063ff2a5d920.webm?t=1790201561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/af34be3ab981dd2ff1cf063ff2a5d920.mp4?t=1790201561\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as Griffin, an agile cat who can dive and scurry up walls. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"270\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/33e2c5ec9135c1e7762a1be1518e8dd9.poster.avif?t=1790201561\" width=\"480\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/33e2c5ec9135c1e7762a1be1518e8dd9.webm?t=1790201561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/33e2c5ec9135c1e7762a1be1518e8dd9.mp4?t=1790201561\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Search the environment for scrap and bring it to your storage car. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"302\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/e687d34c957c498f837cf8af07ac2417.poster.avif?t=1790201561\" width=\"540\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/e687d34c957c498f837cf8af07ac2417.webm?t=1790201561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/e687d34c957c498f837cf8af07ac2417.mp4?t=1790201561\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once you've collected enough scrap, summon your drone to begin building<strong> bridges, elevators, fans, slide rails,</strong> and more to help rebuild and reconnect the world! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"270\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/ea1df828f07f47eed0a8a37583fb0b20.poster.avif?t=1790201561\" width=\"480\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/ea1df828f07f47eed0a8a37583fb0b20.webm?t=1790201561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/ea1df828f07f47eed0a8a37583fb0b20.mp4?t=1790201561\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your speedy train to transport passengers and travel large distances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"270\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/3d59951565da3518123cf4a766ebbbc0.poster.avif?t=1790201561\" width=\"480\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/3d59951565da3518123cf4a766ebbbc0.webm?t=1790201561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/3d59951565da3518123cf4a766ebbbc0.mp4?t=1790201561\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Griffin ran away from home as a child and was raised under the supervision of a conductor named Mr. Marco. Twenty years later, he now lives in the town of Matador. He carries deep wounds from his father and has lived a life full of mistakes and regrets. He spends his days devoid of true fulfillment, in a world that has fallen apart around him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>One day, he receives a letter from his mother. His father is sick and will likely pass away soon.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Griffin is conflicted... <i>should</i>\u00a0he go home? The railroads aren't what they used to be... and the journey will be long. Ultimately, he decides to embark on a perilous adventure back to his home country.\u00a0He will have to use every skill and tool available to him to make it back in time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each chapter will test his character as he reflects upon his life and his past choices. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make new friends and reunite with old ones. Build relationships and <strong>make minor decisions that affect some levels.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Will you make it home in time? What will you say? </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>More importantly...</strong>\u00a0<strong>can Griffin change and grow past his struggles?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"336\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/89b9bce723ebd2ee86b946baca157ad6.poster.avif?t=1790201561\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/89b9bce723ebd2ee86b946baca157ad6.webm?t=1790201561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/extras/89b9bce723ebd2ee86b946baca157ad6.mp4?t=1790201561\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Conductor Cat is a narrative-driven adventure game about rebuilding a broken world. Gather scrap, build machines, and restore a dying canyon as Griffin the cat. He's journeying home aboard his train, racing to see his father one last time.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671980/db22435160db6a0f95e5995262218735800bd2fd/header.jpg?t=1790201561", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Adventure", "Story Rich", "Steampunk", "Cats", "Trains", "Platformer"], "developers": "Grimm Tales LLC", "publishers": "Grimm Tales LLC", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "2671980", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "22 September 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/XS17zuuFTt4", "first_seen": 1790028000.0, "review_rank": 5}